                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "17ec60c4-7446-4a66-be04-987561aaa528",
                        "entry_id": "506978c5-563e-3a60-a54e-858eea79351e",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "géo-ingénieries"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "0ab79d94-c209-4167-a03d-dcd1ccad7c0c",
                        "entry_id": "506978c5-563e-3a60-a54e-858eea79351e",
                        "tags": [],
                        "form": "géoingénierie"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9b957ec5-b5fb-3d8a-8e9c-27010807882a",
                        "entry_id": "506978c5-563e-3a60-a54e-858eea79351e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Ensemble des techniques visant à modifier les paramètres environnementaux à l’échelle planétaires."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Géophysique",
                            "Ingénierie"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "07053442-001a-4d61-b2e3-211d668d6a6e",
                                "sense_id": "9b957ec5-b5fb-3d8a-8e9c-27010807882a",
                                "text": "De mon point de vue, la géo-ingénierie est comparable à ce que les médecins appellent un « traitement de rattrapage », ou parfois de sauvetage : une thérapie potentiellement dangereuse, à utiliser quand toutes les autres ont échoué."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ac307790-4f7e-482e-a405-ab86955419b0",
                                "sense_id": "9b957ec5-b5fb-3d8a-8e9c-27010807882a",
                                "text": "Et puis la géo-ingénierie n’a pas besoin d’ennemis quand elle a des amis qui prônent l’eugénisme et défendent les engrais ou les pesticides au prétexte que « c’est le progrès » et que « la révolution verte a fait manger beaucoup de gens »."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "45b67ed1-7050-45d3-9cf0-b963a3b0ae33",
                                "sense_id": "9b957ec5-b5fb-3d8a-8e9c-27010807882a",
                                "text": "La chercheuse de l’Iris Marine de Guglielmo Weber observe une course entre certains États pour être les premiers à maîtrise la géo-ingénierie solaire."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5a239ecd-dcae-47a4-b66c-718a848dfbcb",
                                "sense_id": "9b957ec5-b5fb-3d8a-8e9c-27010807882a",
                                "text": "Il y a d’autres techniques encore plus avancées : on appelle ça la géo-ingénierie, c’est-à-dire la manipulation artificielle du climat."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "93ce6277-d19d-492e-aebb-265ca9bd10bd",
                        "source_entry_id": "506978c5-563e-3a60-a54e-858eea79351e",
                        "source_sense_id": "9b957ec5-b5fb-3d8a-8e9c-27010807882a",
                        "target_lang_word": "geoengineering",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "geoengineering",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0f57a1b6-345e-3ec6-966c-cb3f0a8dd8c9",
                                        "entry_id": "1e35b0fc-faa5-33d6-8393-87501e5182f9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The subfield of engineering concerned with designing and constructing tunnels, mines, and other human-designed geologic structures within and on earth."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "03a7f9ad-4a80-4166-9d40-9c63f28402bd",
                                                "sense_id": "0f57a1b6-345e-3ec6-966c-cb3f0a8dd8c9",
                                                "text": "“You could say it's one of the first geoengineering projects ever,” says [Carlo] Ratti of the patchwork of land-spattered lagoon that human ingenuity formed into a city, as we settle on the terrace of the Hotel Monaco with an espresso. “This wasn't meant for human living.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "eabe5a9a-d212-3466-a4d2-f054c39dd003",
                                        "entry_id": "1e35b0fc-faa5-33d6-8393-87501e5182f9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The artificial manipulation of the environments of a planet, especially Earth, especially as a means of counteracting global warming."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "862ae8ab-fed7-4127-8453-d5f3dc4f9c14",
                                                "sense_id": "eabe5a9a-d212-3466-a4d2-f054c39dd003",
                                                "text": "Near-synonyms: planetary engineering, terraforming"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "08ae4fc7-562b-44ed-8eed-4ebdc462921b",
                                                "sense_id": "eabe5a9a-d212-3466-a4d2-f054c39dd003",
                                                "text": "Although the panel does not support even pilot programs, it calls geoengineering “technically feasible in terms of cooling effects and costs” and says it has “the potential to affect greenhouse warming on a substantial scale.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d29a97fb-a139-4d0a-a531-cdb4ac65be65",
                                                "sense_id": "eabe5a9a-d212-3466-a4d2-f054c39dd003",
                                                "text": "Although he views large-scale geoengineering as an act of profound hubris[…]he thinks it may be necessary as an emergency measure, much like kidney dialysis is necessary to a person whose health is failing."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7cee6cbe-6be7-4467-9200-ef328332729f",
                                                "sense_id": "eabe5a9a-d212-3466-a4d2-f054c39dd003",
                                                "text": "A scientist gets into geoengineering, they're not a scientist anymore, they're a politician. Get hate mail, rocks through window, no one takes their real work seriously, all that."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
